// ───────────────────────────── next-day bank tally of UPI & card (v18.24, 29 Oct 2026) ─────────────────────────────
// The app reads the ICICI e-mails in nutzyfoods@gmail.com (no bank login):
//  • "Account Statement from ICICI Bank" (.txt.zip, pipe separated): ICICI UPI QR credits "TLTM/UPI/…/UPIIN to NUTZY FOODS" (paid the
//    next morning, gross; MDR debited separately as "TLTM/UPI/…/MDRCC"), Paytm NEFT "PAYTM PAYMENTS SERVICES … AWSPGyyyymmdd…" (one
//    net amount per Paytm batch day = the day of sale), ICICI card machine lump "EZY/ICICIPOS_SET…" (net, info only).
//  • "MerchantStatement-dd-MMM-yyyy" (.xlsx or .zip): every card payment on the ICICI machine (RRN, amount, charges, GST, net).
// Per sales day: UPI + card sold (this app + QueueBuster, all stores and events) against what reached the bank.
const BK_TAB = 'Bank Credits', BK_H = ['Key', 'Credited on', 'Sales date', 'Source', 'Amount ₹', 'Detail', 'Read at'];
