function bkTerminals_() { const o = { EP292213: 'Central Market – Sector 120' }; String(setting_('Card terminals (ID = store)', '') || '').split(/[,;\n]+/).forEach(p => { const m = p.split('='); if (m.length === 2 && m[0].trim()) o[m[0].trim().toUpperCase()] = m[1].trim(); }); return o; }
/** Reads new ICICI statement e-mails into "Bank Credits" / "Card Settlements". Runs at most every 30 min unless forced. */
function bkScan_(force) {
